When filling out a form, understanding your PII (Personally Identifiable Information) like passports and Social Security Numbers (SSN) is crucial. 

The SSN is formatted as AAA-GG-SSSS:
1. Area Number (first three digits)
2. Group Number (the middle section digits)
3. Serial Number (last four digits)

